# A signal store or state file copied in for debugging. Both hold the names of
# real alerts and the times they fired.
*.sqlite*
/homebridge-pagerduty/
state.json*

# Never commit an integration key. The scripts read it from the environment or
# prompt for it; neither writes one, but a hand-made file here would be one
# keystroke from a public repository, and anyone holding it can page you.
.pagerduty-key
